/P 99 0 R
/E (First, they should use strong multi-factor authentication so that a stolen password alone cannot provide access. They should also give employees access only to the information required for their jobs. This limits the amount of data an attacker can reach through one compromised account.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
